full-query: "You are working in a big organization as a DevOps engineer. There is a monolithic application that is deployed and maintained in AWS EC2 The application needs to be redesigned to be microservices. The new serverless event-based architecture will decouple services and components so that the application becomes more extensible. You need a central AWS service to manage the events among application components and also allow you to receive events from third-party SaaS apps such as PageDuty. Which of the following AWS services would you recommend in the new architecture?"
